📅 ${activeBookings} Active Booking${activeBookings !== 1 ? 's' : ''}
📆 ${upcomingBookings} Check-in${upcomingBookings !== 1 ? 's' : ''} This Week

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
👇 *Tap a button below to manage:*`;

